   🚀 **Quickstart**


.. div:: sd-fs-5
 
   Siconos is an open-source scientific software package for **modelling and simulation of nonsmooth dynamical systems** in C++ and Python.

   Our main applications are mechanical systems (rigid or solid) with unilateral contact and Coulomb friction
   and impact (nonsmooth mechanics, contact dynamics, multibody systems dynamics or granular materials).
   Other constitutive models are being developed to model plasticity, damage, cohesive zones. 



